&lt;h3 class=&quot;text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold&quot;&gt;Join Proton and build a better internet where privacy is the default&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Proton was founded in 2014 by scientists from CERN on a simple truth: &lt;strong&gt;privacy is a fundamental human right&lt;/strong&gt;. Since then, we&#39;ve built the world&#39;s largest encrypted email service (Proton Mail) and expanded into Proton VPN, Proton Drive, Proton Pass, and Proton Calendar — tools used by millions globally to protect their freedom, fight censorship, and keep their data safe. In some situations, Proton has literally helped save lives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;We are profitable, independent (no VC control), and selectively hire from the top ~1% of applicants. Our 700+ team members across 50+ countries come from leading organizations and elite academic backgrounds. We move fast, keep hierarchy light, and prioritize impact over optics. If you want to do meaningful work with exceptionally high-caliber people, this is it. Check our open-source projects &lt;a class=&quot;underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current&quot; href=&quot;https://proton.me/community/open-source&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;Lexical__h3&quot;&gt;Purpose of the role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Head of Product to own the overall product strategy and roadmap for Proton Inbox. You&#39;ll set the vision for the core inbox experience and manage a team of Product Managers. You&#39;ll work closely with engineering leadership, design, growth and marketing to turn that vision into a roadmap the team can execute against, and you&#39;ll represent Mail in company-wide product planning and tradeoffs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;Lexical__h3&quot;&gt;What you will do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;Lexical__ul Lexical__ul--depth-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Develop the Proton Mail product strategy to achieve business goals in terms of weekly users, revenues, ARR and P&amp;amp;L growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Drive the execution of the product roadmap from inception to launch, define product vision and strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Manage, coach, and grow a team of Product Managers, setting clear priorities, raising the bar on product craft, and building out the team as scope expands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Partner with engineering, marketing and growth teams to develop and launch major product initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Represent Mail in company-wide planning, making the case for resourcing and negotiating tradeoffs against other Proton product lines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Define and own the product KPIs for Mail, and hold the team accountable for moving them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;7&quot;&gt;Work closely with design and user research to ground roadmap decisions in real user needs and behaviour&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;8&quot;&gt;Communicate roadmap, progress, and rationale clearly to executive leadership and cross-functional stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;Lexical__h3&quot;&gt;Job requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;Lexical__ul Lexical__ul--depth-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Proven experience owning a major product area end to end, ideally in consumer or productivity software at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Experience hiring, managing, coaching, and developing a team of Product Managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Track record of setting product vision and roadmap and successfully bringing engineering, design, and other stakeholders along with you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Strong technical fluency, comfortable partnering with engineering leadership on architecture, sequencing, and implementation tradeoffs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Strong communication and stakeholder management skills, with comfort presenting to and influencing executive leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;A strong bias toward shipping and iterating, matching Proton&#39;s culture of hands-on builders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;7&quot;&gt;Willingness and ability to travel regularly within Europe and support team development across multiple hubs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;8&quot;&gt;A cost-efficient, scrappy mindset, as Proton is bootstrapped and wins through smart execution rather than big budgets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;Lexical__listItem&quot; value=&quot;9&quot;&gt;Comfort with ambiguity and a willingness to make bold, high-conviction calls about where a product should go next&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold&quot;&gt;What We Offer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work that Matters:&lt;/strong&gt; Millions of people trust Proton with their privacy. We answer only to our users — not advertisers, not investors with conflicting agendas, not governments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Great Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Diverse, collaborative, and tight-knit, with people from MIT, Harvard, Stanford, Caltech, Cambridge, ETH, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology:&lt;/strong&gt; The right hardware and software to do your best work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development:&lt;/strong&gt; We invest in your growth. Proton is one of the fastest ways to accelerate your career — real challenges, real ownership, from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong health coverage, solid retirement options, generous leave, and wellness support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stock Options:&lt;/strong&gt; From day one, you have a real stake in what we&#39;re building. When Proton wins, you win.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In-Person Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Offices across Geneva, Zürich, Barcelona, London, and more. You&#39;ll spend most of your time collaborating face-to-face.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Food:&lt;/strong&gt; Lunch and snacks on us every day in the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transport:&lt;/strong&gt; We cover public transport, bike allowances, or parking — whichever works for you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Working:&lt;/strong&gt; You own your schedule. Outcomes matter more than clock-in times.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;At Proton, we believe diversity drives innovation and strengthens our mission to provide privacy as a default for all. We are committed to fostering an inclusive environment where all individuals — regardless of race, ethnicity, gender, age, sexual orientation, physical ability, or socio-economic background — feel valued and empowered.&lt;/p&gt;
