&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DIVERSITY, EQUITY &amp;amp; INCLUSION:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Freenow is an equal opportunity employer and we consider qualified applicants regardless of race, religion, national origin, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability or age. &lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We want you to grow and evolve, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;bring your true self to work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT FREENOW:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Freenow by Lyft empowers smarter mobility decisions, helping people to move freely and cities to thrive. Through our multi-mobility app, we feature broad options for everyone across 9 European markets and over 180 cities. Millions of passengers can access services including taxis, private hire vehicles, carsharing, car rental, e-scooters, e-bikes, e-mopeds, and public transport within a single app.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In July 2025 Freenow was acquired by Lyft, a global mobility platform, which connects riders and drivers for billions of rides across North America and Europe. Together, Freenow and Lyft are creating a more caring and connected world, with transportation for everyone. We are a global, diverse, highly motivated, and collaborative team that strives for excellence and likes to have fun. Ready for your next ride?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.glassdoor.de/%C3%9Cberblick/Arbeit-bei-FREE-NOW-EI_IE954578.11,19.htm&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://eu-images.contentstack.com/v3/assets/blt6e28a7086c72dd55/bltadef6ed7354e9cc4/65a10957984e23040a418da6/glassdoor-logotype-rgb_2.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;150&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kununu.com/de/mytaxi-intelligent-apps&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://eu-images.contentstack.com/v3/assets/blt6e28a7086c72dd55/blte53af231aaa0c840/65a109382311a30407ba07ce/kununu_logo_black_2.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;150&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/free-now/life/2b1603ea-741a-49f8-9847-f1214f483a1a/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://brand.linkedin.com/content/dam/me/business/en-us/amp/brand-site/v2/bg/LI-Logo.svg.original.svg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;143&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Freenow empowers smarter mobility decisions helping people to move freely and cities to thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an exciting time to join us: Freenow is now part of Lyft, and we&#39;re growing our tech organization as we integrate with Lyft&#39;s global platform and systems. That means more scale, more engineering depth to learn from, and more opportunity to shape how our systems evolve as we bring the two worlds together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are keen to hire a Backend Engineer for our FinTech Team - building the systems for controlled and transparent money flows - both for our mobility customers and our mobility providers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our work offers our customers a tailor made and convenient payment experience while creating transparency with our partners about their financials, building our most important value with them: Trust.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be ready to work in a multinational, diverse, highly motivated and collaborative team of passionate developers who strive for excellence and like to have fun. Are you ready for your next ride?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR DAILY ADVENTURES WILL INCLUDE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own features end-to-end - from design and coding through testing, deployment and monitoring - with increasing independence and less need for close guidance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and build microservices and APIs that are clean, well-documented and easy for other teams to consume&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take part in code reviews as a reviewer as well as an author, helping raise the bar on quality across the codebase&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively spot edge cases, gaps in test coverage, and technical debt, and help address them before they become problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with your team members in an agile environment, contribute to and help improve our agile ceremonies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support monitoring, alerting and incident response for the services your team owns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help ramp up and support junior colleagues on the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay on top of the latest technology trends and apply best practices to our daily work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve real problems that impact real users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have around 0.5 million users accessing our product monthly, this is across all European countries that we operate in.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When offering and monetizing reliable, easy-to-use and innovative mobility services to them, the FinTech scalability and reliability are core contributors for the business success, with the ability to adjust and fit different market requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While being both enabler and driver for diverse business initiatives, it&#39;s important especially for financial services to stay compliant with regulations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be part of our teams, bring in your ideas and evolve with us a high quality software system that makes it easy to stay compliant and boost our business at the same time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Techstack&lt;/strong&gt;: Java | Kotlin | AWS | Docker | Git | Kafka | ElasticSearch &amp;amp; &lt;a href=&quot;https://stackshare.io/free-now&quot;&gt;more&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO BE SUCCESSFUL IN THIS ROLE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-5 years of software engineering experience working with Kotlin or Java in production systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;While we typically look for candidates with advanced university degrees in Maths, Statistics, Computer Science, Engineering, or other quantitative disciplines, we&#39;re happy for you to prove us wrong and show that these degrees aren&#39;t necessary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable designing RESTful APIs (filtering, versioning, pagination) and reasoning about event-driven architectures, transactions and resiliency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid, idiomatic experience with Spring (Boot) or a similar JVM framework, and a good understanding of relational databases and JPA/ORM patterns - not just how to use them, but why&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working independently through ambiguous requirements, and confident debugging unfamiliar parts of a large codebase&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong testing habits across the software lifecycle (unit / integration / system), with an eye for edge cases and failure modes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to communicate technical topics clearly to different audiences, including non-technical stakeholders, and to explain the reasoning behind your technical decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable using AI coding assistants as part of your day-to-day workflow, while staying accountable for the quality and correctness of what ships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable contributing to on-call rotations and incident resolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preferably knowledge of financial systems like invoicing and payouts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
