&lt;p data-pos=&quot;274&quot;&gt;The Business Applications Development team is a vital integrational hub within JetBrains. We are focused on supporting businesses by automating sales flow and license management, as well as by developing other internal and external services. We ensure the completeness, continuity, and high quality of JetBrains’ sales and licensing processes. Our solutions are a family of web applications written mostly in Kotlin.&lt;/p&gt;
